cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "soft-hydraulic-ale-fsi: Arbitrary Lagrangian--Eulerian fluid--structure interaction solvers for soft hydraulics"
abstract: >-
  Arbitrary Lagrangian-Eulerian (ALE) fluid-structure interaction solvers, built
  on FEniCSx/DOLFINx, for soft hydraulics problems: pressure-driven flows in
  compliant conduits in which a viscous (and inertial) flow and an elastic solid
  are two-way coupled. Includes a transient quasi-direct solver and monolithic
  steady solvers, generalized Newtonian (Carreau) fluids, a neo-Hookean solid,
  and benchmarks against analytical soft-hydraulics theory.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Ivan C."
    family-names: Christov
    affiliation: "Purdue University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8531-0531"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ichristov/soft-hydraulic-ale-fsi"
